Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你开的太过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.37,0:00:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的驾驶技术怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.59,0:00:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 前面有陨石群
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:00:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要撞到了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.94,0:01:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 还以为你要不行了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得不错嘛 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 一口气冲过去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这样下去会完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:41.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快180度旋转
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆哆哆 哆啦A梦 控制杆不听使唤...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 GAME OVER了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.52,0:02:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香也被打败了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.95,0:02:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样 我跟小夫...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.51,0:02:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去终点了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.77,0:02:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在背后搞偷袭 太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.95,0:02:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样也好 赢了就行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这样 再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个游戏有点太难了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我就说过很难的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到底 都是因为你经常跟小夫争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 他那么的自满
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙旅行？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 是爸爸买给我的生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真羡慕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不去一两次宇宙旅行 会被人笑老套的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从大宇宙看上去 地球就跟豆子一样小
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 从宇宙那里看地球 非常的美丽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.23,0:03:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以拜托爸爸准备你们的份哦 怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知心的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(71.339,470)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有大雄的份
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有言在先 去的话要接受训练的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又迟钝又没运动神经的没用鬼大雄 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 没我这么有体力跟勇敢的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 什么时候出发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天吗 后天吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:11.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能这么快就能去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.35,0:04:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要等到21世纪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 我马上就去拜托哆啦A梦带我去宇宙旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知心的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拜托爸爸准备大雄的份吧 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才拿出这个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不到一会儿就完蛋了 真无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 很快就到终点了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:47.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我不会输给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 操控失灵 怎么回事...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.06,0:05:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小 小夫 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.76,0:05:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输了应该会被退出外面的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.51,0:05:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难 难道我们被困在游戏里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:32.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害 是有生命的树
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.47,0:07:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这么多天然的泥土
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:23.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于找到了 我们居住的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去调查一下这个星球的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『室内宇宙飞船』
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.90,0:07:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以在室内体验宇宙船内的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:46.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好有趣的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:50.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设置到地球跟月亮之间的距离 好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:52.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.13,0:07:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:07:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没重力了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.01,0:08:04.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我控制不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就会习惯的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:14.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经习惯了 好有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.56,0:08:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都分不清上下了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.42,0:08:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没有重力 所以没有上下的分别
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 出去外面看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在这房间里面相当于宇宙船 打开窗户的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会跟空气一起被吸去外面的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.39,0:08:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样子啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我们喝剩的汽水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.35,0:08:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像肥皂泡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 不要这样子啦 会沾到衣服的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:09:01.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里放屁的话 会像火箭一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:02.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你们静点玩好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.31,0:09:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 吃西瓜...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈的声音...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家里全成了宇宙船的状态了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 谁帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得赶快停止才行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总是搞这些恶作剧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快给我收拾干净
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便整理好不要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 漫画、模型空盒子满地都是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:11.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄完了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.18,0:11:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算收拾好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像大扫除似的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 胖虎他们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 还在游戏里面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 那个『星球撞击游戏』在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:25.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道去了哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:36.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.02,0:11:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 知不知道画着宇宙图画的 这么大的盒子在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:47.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个模型盒子吗 跟垃圾一起扔掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:48.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去找...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来 你们收拾好房间了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:11:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找清楚看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会没有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的确扔在那里的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去找一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两人明明还没收拾好房间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:23.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫怎样了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:27.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏结束后应该会出来的说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.90,0:12:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们果然还没回家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪 应该早就到终点 或是game over了的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是游戏出了故障 被困在游戏里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.53,0:12:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是那游戏在垃圾站不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们的错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到可能太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:12:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:02.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『历史照相机』
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这时候照相有什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个照相机可以追溯之前的时间摄像的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如设置到四小时前
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄放屁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后是窗破了 游戏吹到了外面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 妈妈收拾东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈啊 拿着那游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去垃圾站
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该可以照到拿走游戏的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,游戏还在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.67,0:13:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的光搬走了游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.73,0:14:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞向这个方向了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.62,0:14:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去那边的拐角了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这里拐弯了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学校的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像去了学校的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是后山吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是去了后山
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你们『竹蜻蜓』
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了山脚的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:52.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:56.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确是在这附近消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.59,0:15:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,UFO？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎跟小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被UFO掠走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我破坏自己赎罪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.95,0:15:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们快去追吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.19,0:15:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『竹蜻蜓』不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不知道那是哪个星球的UFO
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:38.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快点拿火箭出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的倒简单
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:42.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙是很广阔的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银河系里像地球一样星球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.83,0:15:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这大宇宙里就有一亿万倍那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个一个找的话 一生也找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.24,0:15:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.73,0:16:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是石头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.99,0:16:05.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像星星的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是地球的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:14.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大发现
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这应该是UFO的驾驶员丢失的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.28,0:16:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这个的话就有办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:21.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:26.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『宇宙救命艇』
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,设定好这块石头的探索装置
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:33.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能在宇宙中追寻这块石头的来历
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 马上出发
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:41.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是宇宙是非常危险的地方 没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这当然知道 但是不能放着他们不管
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 马上出发
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.42,0:16:55.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快要达到瞬间跳跃极限 快要达到瞬间跳跃极限
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃结束 瞬间跳跃结束
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离子风暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得 得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.63,0:18:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里不是大雄的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是哪儿的工厂仓库
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有扇门
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像从外面上锁了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.07,0:18:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 纹丝不动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:59.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像科幻电影一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还在游戏里面...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都还在瞬间跳跃的空间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去哪儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像去了漫无边际的遥远宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像从瞬间跳跃里出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说接近那块石头的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发 发生什么事了 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是进入离子风暴里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照片上看到过的UFO
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.69,0:20:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说胖虎跟小夫就在那里面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎被击中了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎 怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去用『时光布』修理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『宇宙霜-喷雾型』
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喷上这个 就等于有穿上宇宙服的状态了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气排出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算打开门也不用担心会被吸出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可真惨...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.27,0:20:58.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:06.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时光布』
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:10.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时光布』...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.89,0:21:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舍弃『救命艇』  快脱出吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们过去UFO那里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:25.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.03,0:21:38.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像是在玩『室内宇宙飞船』那样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 这里是真正的宇宙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.89,0:21:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到了 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这种地方 亏你还能放出屁来...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.94,0:21:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点进去里面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.36,0:21:58.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『通行圈』
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.71,0:22:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好像是仓库
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会有人在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.98,0:22:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点 因为不知道是什么样的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:23.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这声音是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.74,0:22:25.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.96,0:22:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3}小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(180.33,470)\fs24}我知心的朋友 太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.54,0:22:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(675.743,470)\fs24}太好了 你们都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.89,0:22:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.23,0:22:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来 这里到底是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.81,0:22:36.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.59,0:22:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.77,0:22:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 被UFO掠走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.65,0:22:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么这里是真正的宇宙？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 竟然会弄错路线
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.26,0:22:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃之后就是这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.34,0:23:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 不走出这里的话就无法航行了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辅助回路 最大出力
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启航
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:22.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源开到最大了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.12,0:23:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一点而已
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.79,0:23:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.97,0:23:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像冲出离子风暴了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.72,0:23:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多破烂儿 要运到哪里去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.47,0:23:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 首先试着交涉看看能不能让我们回地球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.76,0:23:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 这个UFO的宇宙人是怎样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.91,0:24:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会发光  还很小的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.54,0:24:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发光？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.17,0:24:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是萤火星人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定 真面目是这样的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 不要这样子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是狐狸星人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.17,0:24:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么都好 应该能好好跟他们商量的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.74,0:24:18.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.49,0:24:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.70,0:24:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人在
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.67,0:24:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会真的是 很可怕的外星人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.50,0:24:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.13,0:24:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么也...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.12,0:24:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你打了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.99,0:24:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.93,0:24:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷静 冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.55,0:24:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.34,0:24:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我们是 说来话长...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.84,0:24:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是宇宙少年骑士团
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.74,0:24:55.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们来我们的宇宙船里 想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.52,0:24:57.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.03,0:25:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊 是你们擅自带我们来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.02,0:25:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们才没有带人上来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.21,0:25:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们随便上来 我要逮捕你们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.61,0:25:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎 抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.88,0:25:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不会让你们得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.85,0:25:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.90,0:25:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是别反抗比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.71,0:25:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开门 放我们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.27,0:25:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然就狠狠揍你们一顿
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.03,0:25:42.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好谈的话 我想他们应该会理解的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.65,0:25:44.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『通行圈』呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.42,0:25:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被没收了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.93,0:25:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些野蛮人到底是哪儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.90,0:25:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 快回去寻找归路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.20,0:26:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 不好了 不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.95,0:26:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 洛古
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.08,0:26:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃航行装置出了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.86,0:26:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.43,0:26:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是刚才的离子风暴的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.45,0:26:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.51,0:26:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,测量一下附近可以着陆的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.82,0:26:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鹤见星系 S56
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.48,0:26:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个未知的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.57,0:26:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就在那里修理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.55,0:26:25.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.05,0:26:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球真美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.91,0:26:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多绿色植物就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.54,0:26:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 准备降落
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.94,0:26:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.88,0:26:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 调查一下大气状况
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.95,0:26:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.55,0:27:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,氯气占95％ 一滴水也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.67,0:27:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多土块
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.09,0:27:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在某个星球着陆了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.40,0:27:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哪儿的星球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.76,0:27:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.41,0:27:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿都好 把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.98,0:27:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿都好 把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.07,0:27:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿都好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.26,0:27:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你有带来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.28,0:27:38.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.95,0:27:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『随意门』
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都完全忘了有这样的法宝
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.29,0:27:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 大家想回哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.62,0:27:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的 我的家里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.86,0:27:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.60,0:27:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就去空地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.74,0:27:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.02,0:27:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.14,0:28:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得来到真正的宇宙 不冒一下险就回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.57,0:28:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冒险已经足够了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.17,0:28:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.48,0:28:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 大雄说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.00,0:28:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就结束的话太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.45,0:28:16.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 看看这个星球再回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.99,0:28:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我不想再让大家犯险了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.29,0:28:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个万一的话马上用『随意门』回去就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.39,0:28:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就一会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 修理状况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.31,0:28:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 完全损坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.65,0:28:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃航行装置用不了的话 回去太耗时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.54,0:28:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要花点时间才能修理好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.23,0:28:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 这次的调查太多问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.64,0:28:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚出发通信机就坏了 无法传送资料
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.39,0:29:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又被奇怪的入侵者闯进
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.69,0:29:04.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞船还故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.20,0:29:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是因为我丢了神树之果
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.35,0:29:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神树之果丢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.97,0:29:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么重要的东西到底在哪儿丢失的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.17,0:29:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大概在MS3那个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.74,0:29:21.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 那个星球真的太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.26,0:29:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要岔开话题
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.69,0:29:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,植物跟泥土都很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.80,0:29:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.49,0:29:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就叫自然美
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.07,0:29:35.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到这个 心情就不由变得平静
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.74,0:29:40.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安看到植物就会变得两眼放光呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.30,0:29:42.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.90,0:29:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是植物叶子的细胞哦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.36,0:29:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 动了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.12,0:29:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是有生命的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.12,0:29:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 跟我们的人造树木完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.51,0:30:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈一直说 想生活在自然的花草树木的星球居住
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.47,0:30:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧 我们一定能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.80,0:30:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.37,0:30:10.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『吃空间虫』
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:14.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃掉超空间 制造出逃生通道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.36,0:30:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青虫型机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.75,0:30:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全起见 给你们都喷上『宇宙霜』
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:25.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虫虫 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.83,0:30:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 做好觉悟了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.83,0:30:32.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 开始宇宙探险了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.85,0:30:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多好的事啊 我要是能办到该多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.21,0:30:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的梦 这样的梦 有好多好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.39,0:30:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.58,0:30:49.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.74,0:30:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,UFO在那里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.90,0:30:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然时间不长 谢谢你们照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.55,0:30:57.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要在这颗星球探险了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.72,0:31:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在口袋之中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.36,0:31:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空好辽阔
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.05,0:31:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在口袋之中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.08,0:31:07.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真让人兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.88,0:31:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪兽什么的 出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.50,0:31:12.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的出现的话该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.09,0:31:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候 就拜托哆啦A梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.48,0:31:24.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.37,0:31:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 先回去UFO里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.53,0:31:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.54,0:31:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超空间被扭曲了 危险
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.41,0:31:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金属身体的蛛蛛...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.55,0:31:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它死了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.52,0:31:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.81,0:31:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快拿武器出来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.63,0:31:59.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我带着的武器都对付不了它的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.01,0:32:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 『随意门』...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.09,0:32:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪 在哪...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.56,0:32:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.85,0:32:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.10,0:32:14.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『随意门』
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.56,0:32:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去大雄的房间  快快
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.20,0:32:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.61,0:32:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.20,0:32:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.19,0:32:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快用『竹蜻蜓』
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.79,0:32:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.51,0:32:46.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真危险
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.09,0:32:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕的蜘蛛
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能喷出金属蜘蛛丝 还有能溶解金属的毒液
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.40,0:32:57.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么『随意门』用不了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.75,0:33:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕我们到了 连『随意门』都去不到的遥远地方
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.53,0:33:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么回去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.51,0:33:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然要靠他们用UFO载我们回去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.90,0:33:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 金属蜘蛛会袭击UFO的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.75,0:33:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.87,0:33:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.52,0:33:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.76,0:33:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.45,0:33:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 这样下去的话UFO会被溶化的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.27,0:33:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快做点什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.52,0:33:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 有个好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.51,0:33:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『吹走的喇叭』
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.85,0:33:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要一吹这个喇叭
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.24,0:33:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都会跟随着喇叭声出发再也回不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.96,0:33:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事后再说明好了 快快
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.82,0:33:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.60,0:34:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像没什么变化
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.59,0:34:02.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是声音太小 听不到？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.26,0:34:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 给我『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.04,0:34:06.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.61,0:34:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.93,0:34:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 绝对能听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.97,0:34:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.83,0:34:17.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 靠近点吹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.06,0:34:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.65,0:34:24.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 看天上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.82,0:34:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 那些人什么时候出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.08,0:34:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且没穿宇宙服
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.88,0:34:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不能掉以轻心
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.10,0:34:34.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 吹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.84,0:34:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.48,0:34:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家看 它们逃到山上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.63,0:35:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了 它们不会再回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.69,0:35:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好宏亮的声音 不愧是胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.04,0:35:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小意思
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.92,0:35:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.86,0:35:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们赶走的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.82,0:35:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『物质转换机』
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.62,0:35:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个将蜘蛛丝换成毛线
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.69,0:35:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毛线？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.64,0:35:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.18,0:35:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.05,0:35:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.35,0:35:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成毛线了 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.58,0:35:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以做围巾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.18,0:35:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不可思议的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.04,0:36:03.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们看来不是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.13,0:36:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 我觉得有点不安
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.29,0:36:07.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.34,0:36:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 只是这么觉得而已
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.56,0:36:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位救了我们 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.90,0:36:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新邀请你们上来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.04,0:36:24.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 这样就有办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.77,0:36:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说他们在这里面？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.89,0:36:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 都是因为随便捡破烂儿才会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.66,0:36:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是破烂儿 也是很好的调查材料
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.75,0:36:38.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是什么破烂儿不破烂儿 这是我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.89,0:36:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起这个 快送我们回地球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.29,0:36:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们不明不白的被你们带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.17,0:36:49.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可伤脑筋 因为瞬间跳跃航行装置故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.93,0:36:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用那个的话不能回地球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.66,0:36:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是说不能回去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.23,0:37:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概要一亿八百万年
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.79,0:37:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一亿年.....
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.35,0:37:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.81,0:37:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是『时光布』跟『救命艇』都没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.86,0:37:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.81,0:37:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个回去的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.20,0:37:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是带他们去银河漂流船队
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.12,0:37:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,银河漂流船队？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.06,0:37:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.41,0:37:22.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我们要回去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.55,0:37:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不像你们那样有个安居的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.24,0:37:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.04,0:37:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 把记录放映出来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.84,0:37:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年前 我们的祖先舍弃了星球
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.19,0:37:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舍弃星球？  为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.97,0:37:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为不能再居住了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.33,0:37:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为物质文明过于发达 环境不断被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.61,0:37:53.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然 大气被破坏 植物枯竭
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.25,0:37:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来变成一个出门都要带上呼吸装置的死亡之星
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.89,0:38:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年以来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.60,0:38:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找寻一个绿色的理想星球
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.36,0:38:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一直在无边的宇宙漂流
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.59,0:38:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,期间会遇到同样失去星球的人们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.74,0:38:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起组成银河漂流船队
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.97,0:38:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是在宇宙船上出生的新一代
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.08,0:39:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了找寻可以让我们居住的母星 而组成了调查团
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.89,0:39:03.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是宇宙少年骑士团
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.01,0:39:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.83,0:39:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们四人在太阳系上找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.19,0:39:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了一个非常美丽的MS3－叫做地球的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.19,0:39:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说找到... 可地球是我们的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.45,0:39:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不会让给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.94,0:39:21.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 我们没打算侵略
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.35,0:39:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是希望通过谈判 达到和平移居地球的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.16,0:39:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是自古流传下来的教导
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.48,0:39:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来先回船队修理好船 就马上送你们回去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.05,0:39:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.81,0:39:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.64,0:39:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.56,0:39:36.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.63,0:39:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,资料机器人 洛古
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.17,0:39:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.52,0:39:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫里安
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.82,0:39:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,源静香
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.60,0:39:45.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫菲莉亚 多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.34,0:39:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.87,0:39:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字是？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.44,0:39:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么 放我下来 放我下来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.21,0:39:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎是这样对人表示友好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.49,0:40:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.70,0:40:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发要花些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.17,0:40:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉就让你们这里稍事休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.89,0:40:07.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.21,0:40:10.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好我们也很累了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.46,0:40:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 地球上出发时已经是夜里了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.24,0:40:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 我想这里没有可以洗澡的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.47,0:40:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.75,0:40:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.14,0:40:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 没有热水出来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.99,0:40:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 因为除了我就没什么人用的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.05,0:40:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微要用点技巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.97,0:40:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.81,0:40:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在里面可以呼吸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.56,0:40:53.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.69,0:40:54.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.52,0:41:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都叫里安每天洗的 他就是不听
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.95,0:41:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟里安真的很要好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.94,0:41:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.38,0:41:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是朋友而已
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.55,0:41:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.98,0:41:14.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能让里安得到幸福的话 我什么都会做
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.24,0:41:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 MS3-地球的资料传来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.71,0:41:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让只老鼠混进那里果然没白费
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.59,0:42:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球果然是个理想的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.96,0:42:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是踏破铁鞋无觅处
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.96,0:42:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 在这之前还有一些问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.26,0:42:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.91,0:42:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说回来 工程还差多少
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.54,0:42:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差些许而已
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.50,0:42:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何 结果一定能让你满意
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.11,0:42:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我期待着 摩亚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.91,0:42:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我忠实的仆人们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.11,0:42:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了得到我们的星球 要尽快完成
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.21,0:43:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然说要帮忙修理 可是我还很困啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.37,0:43:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人也会困的吗 真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.56,0:43:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请把那片电路板更换一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.90,0:43:13.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果『时光布』在就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.02,0:43:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的机器人拥有的道具真神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.50,0:43:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是从未来来的机器人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.10,0:43:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说 现在...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.52,0:43:25.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 住手 现在是重要的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.14,0:43:31.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要吃我 我不好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.06,0:43:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个 这个...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.51,0:43:41.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『万能缰绳』
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.12,0:43:43.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.13,0:43:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.40,0:43:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦要被吃掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.93,0:43:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.77,0:43:51.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.56,0:43:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哟 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.57,0:43:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它很温驯 大家也来坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.18,0:44:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 不要吓人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.29,0:44:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.16,0:44:06.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安也来坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.78,0:44:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 坐上去舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.68,0:44:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样还是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.59,0:44:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们拥有的力量真神奇
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.71,0:44:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是托哆啦A梦的福
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.51,0:44:19.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真神奇 有些什么机关的？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.76,0:44:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手被缠住了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.94,0:44:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.53,0:44:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.06,0:44:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.86,0:44:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.81,0:44:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悬崖...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.67,0:44:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.27,0:45:03.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是危险
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.49,0:45:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了我 大雄真勇敢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.34,0:45:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.19,0:45:11.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人这么说还是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.79,0:45:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.81,0:45:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.78,0:45:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.49,0:45:16.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.57,0:45:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.80,0:45:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发准备OK
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.41,0:45:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 出发咯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.21,0:45:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不好 毛线还没清理
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.19,0:45:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧 这不影响出发
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.34,0:45:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.83,0:45:38.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.22,0:46:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于可以去船队了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.41,0:46:04.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 因为没有用瞬间跳跃航行装置
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.08,0:46:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,途中得找个星球停下来 让引擎休息
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.39,0:46:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去船队要花些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.72,0:46:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 还要这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.73,0:46:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 这总比要花一亿年要好嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.84,0:46:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.33,0:46:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到星球的话再通知你们
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.17,0:46:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这之前先休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.46,0:46:24.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.16,0:46:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这么多星球 却不能让生物居住
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.87,0:46:43.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,船队的人都已经找了三百年
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.61,0:46:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是让自己的星球变得不堪的祖先的不好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.55,0:46:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地震？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.34,0:46:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能 这里可是UFO里面啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.07,0:46:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.41,0:46:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.14,0:47:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是引擎故障的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.94,0:47:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.63,0:47:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 偏离轨道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.23,0:47:09.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被什么拉住了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.05,0:47:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 快去调查原因
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.25,0:47:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.94,0:47:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.39,0:47:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.46,0:47:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一光年前面 有个黑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.54,0:47:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑洞？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.21,0:47:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 引擎开到最大
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.66,0:47:43.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到正常航道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.76,0:47:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.93,0:47:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.46,0:47:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才真危险 如果再近一点的话
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.33,0:47:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会被吸进去 再也出不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.77,0:48:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.27,0:48:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽快 找寻可以着陆的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.27,0:48:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为引擎有些负荷过重了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.13,0:48:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真想看看那个黑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.99,0:48:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 真到了能看到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.91,0:48:20.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会被吸进去 再也回不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.97,0:48:24.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周围的星球也好 什么东西都会被吸进去的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.58,0:48:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.18,0:48:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才是什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.84,0:48:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我肚子饿得像黑洞一样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.62,0:48:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.21,0:48:43.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没找到可以着陆的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.39,0:48:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 航道有点偏离 不过找到一个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.16,0:48:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑能源状况 还是快点着陆比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.75,0:48:54.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就在那里着陆
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.37,0:49:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真大的雾啊 洛古
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.69,0:49:11.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 雷达...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.31,0:49:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.42,0:49:41.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.64,0:49:42.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.87,0:49:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在某个星球着陆了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.74,0:49:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甲板开着
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.78,0:49:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安他们先下去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.31,0:49:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也出去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.68,0:50:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的雾
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.24,0:50:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个气味是？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.78,0:50:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟后山的树一样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.90,0:50:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.32,0:50:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.82,0:50:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是雾散了是地球的话
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.19,0:50:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 这种玩笑不要开啦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.62,0:50:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雾散了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.26,0:50:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.03,0:50:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.83,0:50:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是后山
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.28,0:50:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到地球了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.97,0:50:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的 真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.00,0:50:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.60,0:50:34.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 待会见
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.61,0:50:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 我玩的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.88,0:50:38.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.78,0:50:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安他们应该早和我们说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.52,0:50:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是想给我们惊喜吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.22,0:50:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.33,0:50:51.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这是之前的测验卷
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.86,0:50:52.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,测验卷？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.12,0:50:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1...100分？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.15,0:50:59.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是给你的奖励 努力学习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.24,0:51:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 谢谢老师
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.00,0:51:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.71,0:51:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是梦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.71,0:51:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要用『梦境确定机』吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.16,0:51:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.27,0:51:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点给妈妈看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.08,0:51:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.67,0:51:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.06,0:51:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.47,0:51:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好几天没回去 妈妈一定会大发雷霆的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.49,0:51:19.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.83,0:51:20.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.53,0:51:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很担心你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.30,0:51:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.81,0:51:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 你回来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.58,0:51:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天好好玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.09,0:51:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.00,0:51:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 给你的铜锣烧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.01,0:51:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.82,0:51:36.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.06,0:51:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.24,0:51:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.89,0:51:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 完全忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.47,0:51:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开地球之前捡到的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.22,0:51:47.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.38,0:51:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.47,0:51:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆 哆 哆啦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.56,0:51:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.60,0:51:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.06,0:51:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多吃一点哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.60,0:51:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.63,0:52:01.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.78,0:52:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.85,0:52:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.28,0:52:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这里不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.04,0:52:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 这不是平时玩耍的空地吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.17,0:52:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我清醒过来 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.76,0:52:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.85,0:52:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们被幻觉迷惑了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.57,0:52:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.30,0:52:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.81,0:52:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.43,0:52:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快唤醒大家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.07,0:52:31.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我找 我找
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.07,0:52:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『唤醒远处的人闹钟』
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.31,0:52:43.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.16,0:52:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我晕过去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.62,0:52:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.51,0:52:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.70,0:52:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄他们 洛古 吾郎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.03,0:53:01.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甲板关上了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.30,0:53:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 快把甲板打开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.01,0:53:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快打开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.29,0:53:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.92,0:53:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开 快开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.91,0:53:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 为什么开不了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.84,0:53:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪 好像故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.51,0:53:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.39,0:53:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快开 快打开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.30,0:53:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了 给我开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.70,0:53:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.73,0:53:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快快
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.96,0:53:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.20,0:53:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.78,0:53:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.13,0:53:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.62,0:53:50.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.91,0:53:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.98,0:53:53.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.21,0:53:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快进去里面
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.27,0:53:55.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.23,0:53:57.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.32,0:54:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻觉之星？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.28,0:54:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们太想回地球了 所以才会被骗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.37,0:54:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然是幻觉...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.28,0:54:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻觉也好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.59,0:54:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经受不了一直在宇宙了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.94,0:54:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.34,0:54:32.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.84,0:54:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前 好想在妈妈还活着的时候 找到合适的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.07,0:54:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是现在 为了银河漂流船队的所有人 我要加油
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.71,0:54:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到船队的轨道了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.12,0:54:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 菲莉亚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.38,0:54:52.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在隔壁的雷达室吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.26,0:54:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.06,0:55:00.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.88,0:55:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.79,0:55:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚是你救了我的吧 我是来跟你道谢的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.41,0:55:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用谢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.30,0:55:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.18,0:55:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.47,0:55:12.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.44,0:55:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就能回去的 不用花一亿年
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.16,0:55:18.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.71,0:55:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.60,0:55:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.87,0:55:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.30,0:55:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有事情发生吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.20,0:55:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.45,0:55:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞船偏离了航路
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.79,0:55:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是操作错误了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.70,0:55:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真失礼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.29,0:55:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.98,0:55:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞船不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.04,0:55:37.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.73,0:55:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.95,0:55:50.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像宇宙船的坟场
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.85,0:55:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太凄惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.84,0:56:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源急速下降 这是矿石生命体
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.33,0:56:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们在吃飞船的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.93,0:56:07.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快被挤坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.55,0:56:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 周围的宇宙船就是被它们弄报废的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.71,0:56:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎停止
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.71,0:56:19.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源开始见底了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.60,0:56:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们走了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.99,0:56:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.60,0:56:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是找到了新的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.53,0:56:40.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.75,0:56:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是飞弹
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.03,0:56:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞弹？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.44,0:56:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.59,0:56:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在快逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.65,0:56:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 没能源了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.86,0:57:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那飞弹是哪儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.97,0:57:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 我们带你们离开
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.42,0:57:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.08,0:57:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那飞船是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.35,0:57:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要带我们去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.91,0:57:17.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安份点跟来就是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.61,0:57:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的飞船都没生命反应
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.17,0:57:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么人在操纵着那些飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.90,0:57:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不去船队的话 就回不了地球对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.15,0:57:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.29,0:57:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只能静观其变
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.56,0:57:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个惑星是？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.36,0:57:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 这里到底是？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.79,0:57:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.43,0:58:04.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很宏伟的要塞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.59,0:58:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于回来了 里安
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.58,0:58:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是被选中的骑士们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.03,0:58:26.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于找到了个理想的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.53,0:58:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.39,0:58:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你在这里 这里是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.84,0:58:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是独立军的前线基地
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.16,0:58:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,独立军？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.90,0:58:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了银河漂流船队的市民们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.48,0:58:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要得到可以居住的母星 而组成的崇高部队
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.20,0:58:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是何时成立的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.97,0:58:51.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们出去调查之后 司令官成立的独立军
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.49,0:58:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了教导吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.78,0:59:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不论什么情况 都不能采用任何侵略手段
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.41,0:59:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说教导 不要笑话了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.29,0:59:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年不断的彷徨
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.06,0:59:10.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是已经终于找到了理想星球－地球了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.11,0:59:13.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.22,0:59:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是潜入你们里面的老鼠报告的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.63,0:59:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠 哪儿 在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.56,0:59:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠是指间谍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.19,0:59:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.20,0:59:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不是真的吧 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.41,0:59:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 通信器不是坏了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.72,0:59:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 是我弄坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.91,0:59:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.48,0:59:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为不想让你知道独立军的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.46,0:59:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我知道你是不会协助的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.13,0:59:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.91,0:59:51.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道甲板打不开的时候也是你...？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.24,0:59:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.45,0:59:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.55,0:59:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们拥有神奇的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.65,1:00:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了里安不被地球人所妨碍
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.08,1:00:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.35,1:00:06.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你救了我...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.19,1:00:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诱导我们去宇宙船的墓场 把我们带来这里也是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.41,1:00:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 这样才更...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.20,1:00:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.31,1:00:17.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全是为了你...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.25,1:00:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.91,1:00:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.67,1:00:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.20,1:00:28.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球 是地球人的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.55,1:00:30.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你考虑清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.79,1:00:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还那么说吗 里安
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.13,1:00:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带这些人去监牢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.20,1:00:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.16,1:00:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.94,1:00:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 请你考虑清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.49,1:00:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.43,1:00:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 过来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.19,1:00:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 请你考虑清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.70,1:00:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.93,1:01:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫他爸爸？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.24,1:01:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个司令官是？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.65,1:01:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特司令官是里安的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.69,1:01:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家原谅
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.58,1:01:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是里安的错
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.63,1:01:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从那个叫摩亚的人来了之后
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.90,1:01:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸跟大家都变了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.48,1:01:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.76,1:01:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官旁边的人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.45,1:01:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安古鲁·摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.53,1:01:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安古鲁·摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.73,1:01:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.73,1:01:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺查丹玛斯的预言里提到 毁灭地球的大魔王的名字\N{\fs23}（诺查丹玛斯：法国医师、占星术师）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.97,1:01:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 哆啦A梦是从22世纪来的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.52,1:01:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚 未来是有可能改变的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.54,1:01:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.48,1:01:46.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管如何 这样下去的话地球很危险
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.73,1:01:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得从这里逃脱 回去船队
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.87,1:01:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.64,1:01:55.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『潜地艇』
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.12,1:01:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是潜水艇吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.91,1:02:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个可以潜入地下 是『潜地艇』
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.56,1:02:05.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现就糟糕了 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.49,1:02:07.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.70,1:02:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 飞船的能源能不能到达母船
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.56,1:02:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该能 如果是逃到母船附近的轨道的话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.24,1:02:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用应急燃料可以去到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.48,1:02:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.41,1:02:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.88,1:02:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.30,1:02:51.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.53,1:03:03.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.70,1:03:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.40,1:03:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 一起走吧 快
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.03,1:03:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.88,1:03:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.85,1:03:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古的操控真好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.47,1:03:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里 都比不上里安啦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.11,1:03:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.59,1:03:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,介绍一个新同伴给大家
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.13,1:03:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新同伴？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.82,1:03:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.53,1:03:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.80,1:04:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 我就知道你一定是站在我们这边的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.37,1:04:10.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎新同伴吧 好吗 吾郎
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.80,1:04:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 菲莉亚 拜托你联络船队
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.61,1:04:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.52,1:04:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 轨道怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.86,1:04:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.03,1:04:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 逃脱了？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.09,1:04:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都吩咐这么多次看好他们的了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.67,1:04:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.09,1:04:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 他们用了神奇的道具才...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.62,1:04:43.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 让地球人去了船队便麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.33,1:04:45.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快去抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.51,1:04:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去追
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.19,1:04:47.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.38,1:04:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚这贱人 居然背叛我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.81,1:05:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 后面有些什么在追着
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.86,1:05:03.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是无人舰
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.20,1:05:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 开大能源逃走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.79,1:05:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊 燃料用尽了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.10,1:05:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 还没联络上船队吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.55,1:05:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该在附近了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.74,1:05:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是独立军捕获船
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.06,1:05:31.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么辛苦才逃出来的说...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.64,1:05:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要被抓回去吗...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.64,1:05:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像逃脱了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.31,1:05:42.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这道光是？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.97,1:05:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.32,1:05:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.07,1:05:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是船队救了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.05,1:05:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.03,1:05:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是母船啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.53,1:05:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.62,1:05:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太大了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.68,1:07:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,MSK少年骑士团 辛苦你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.36,1:07:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请马上去协议会
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.11,1:07:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎MS3地球人 我们欢迎你们的到来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.99,1:07:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像知道我们的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.37,1:07:12.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉了他们大体的情况了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.85,1:07:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.65,1:07:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你们跟我一起 去协议会报告一直以来的情况
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.67,1:07:25.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 这都是为了地球
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.12,1:07:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕摩亚的战略是 打算侵略地球之前 用武力支配母船
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.64,1:07:36.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸竟然会发动战争 简直难以相信
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.73,1:07:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安古鲁·摩亚到底是何方神圣
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.83,1:07:46.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.25,1:07:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好强大
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.71,1:07:51.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙船里面居然有这样的大都市
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.45,1:07:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多少人口
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.90,1:07:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大约一千万人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.31,1:07:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是拉古娜星人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.16,1:08:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年间 像吾郎这样 从其他星球来的住民也很多
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.00,1:08:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是协议会的联邦大厦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.88,1:08:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到银河漂流船队
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.65,1:08:19.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位就是勇敢的地球少年吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.43,1:08:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是协议会议长摩滋拉
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.55,1:08:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 马上开始汇报吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.50,1:08:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.44,1:08:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球的诸位也拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.06,1:08:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.98,1:08:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,独立军打算用武力支配船队
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.36,1:08:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还打算侵略他们的星球－地球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.45,1:08:41.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特司令官怎么会做这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.24,1:08:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从摩亚来了之后 他就变得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.01,1:08:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有逃跑了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.60,1:08:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要舍弃船队吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.19,1:08:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这时候得战斗才行了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.72,1:08:54.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我们不懂如何战斗啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.57,1:08:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 现在不是说这话的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.07,1:09:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年历史以来 我们还没打过一场仗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.11,1:09:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕 将来也不会打破这个教导的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.20,1:09:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 我们已经没时间考虑了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.69,1:09:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.48,1:09:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去圣域请求神的教导吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.68,1:09:19.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说的神是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.99,1:09:22.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还说去圣域来着
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.06,1:09:31.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,圣域是这艘船里 唯一有自然生态的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.69,1:09:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神就在那里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.12,1:09:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的指导者 也是我们的生命之源
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.92,1:09:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底他是怎样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.28,1:09:42.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并非是人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.58,1:09:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我们的神 尤古道之树
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.61,1:10:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三百年前 我们的祖先离开惑星拉古娜的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.52,1:10:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个少年 在瓦砾之间的一块土地上 发现一颗发光的树苗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.62,1:10:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很小心地带回船上
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.57,1:10:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后 大家很小心地照料这颗树苗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.75,1:10:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从此以来 我们从尤古道之树上学会很多知识
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.29,1:10:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在她作为我们的神 存在于我们的心中
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.53,1:10:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悲伤 辛苦 迷惘的时候 就会抚摸这个果实听从教导
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.11,1:10:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个形状...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.44,1:10:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟这个一样
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.76,1:10:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神树之果 这个在哪儿捡到的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.14,1:10:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们从地球出发的时候丢的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.42,1:10:51.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这颗树的果实啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.72,1:11:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这颗果实 是尤古道之树给少年骑士团的信物
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.82,1:11:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使离开船队 也会保护我们
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.59,1:11:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是护身符一样的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.37,1:11:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 在幻觉之星让我清醒过来的 是这个护身符啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.97,1:11:18.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 还给你 不要再丢失了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.70,1:11:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.40,1:11:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 里安 请求尤古道之树的教导吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.97,1:11:30.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.26,1:11:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.79,1:11:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.14,1:11:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇迹 已经过世的里安的妈妈...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.42,1:11:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安的妈妈已经死了？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.64,1:11:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在里安还小的时候...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.36,1:11:57.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸他...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.53,1:11:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.11,1:12:00.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.49,1:12:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做的事只有一样
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.11,1:12:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要打倒摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.66,1:12:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒摩亚？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.17,1:12:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把控制爸爸的摩亚打倒
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.64,1:12:13.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚用超能力控制人心
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.12,1:12:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他操纵了船队的几个人 成立了独立军
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.63,1:12:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒摩亚 独立军就会瓦解
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.30,1:12:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都会变回和平
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.16,1:12:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有这种力量的摩亚 我们能对付得了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.33,1:12:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧 看看周围
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.19,1:12:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是有爱你 信任你...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.56,1:12:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...能够依靠的 新的同伴吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.18,1:12:47.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟神树之果一起 永远守护着你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.59,1:12:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 不要迷惘 勇敢前进
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.18,1:12:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.90,1:12:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要迷惘 勇敢前进
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.87,1:13:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.64,1:13:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球人和盖亚号的人合流了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.74,1:13:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得赶快让司令官下决定
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.12,1:13:12.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 你在犹豫什么
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.46,1:13:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴多列布军团出击
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.87,1:13:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向盖亚号发动总攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.05,1:13:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.86,1:13:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大量独立军的战斗机 正在向这边赶来了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.89,1:13:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于来了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.44,1:13:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.23,1:13:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 里安
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.75,1:13:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去打倒摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.48,1:13:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.30,1:13:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 我一定会将和平带回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.14,1:13:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(428.037,415)\fs26}宇宙少年骑士团全体出击
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.16,1:14:02.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(428.037,415)\fs26}重复 宇宙少年骑士团全体出击
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.66,1:14:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 加油
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.82,1:14:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.51,1:14:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.65,1:14:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洛古 燃料怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.52,1:14:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常充足
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.57,1:14:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾郎 加油哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.04,1:14:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们也出击吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.75,1:14:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 一定要保护好地球
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.31,1:14:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.74,1:14:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.80,1:14:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.80,1:14:26.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们用游戏里面的宇宙船战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.29,1:14:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.44,1:14:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.66,1:14:29.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.66,1:14:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.32,1:14:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要保护好里安哦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.43,1:14:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.84,1:14:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开游戏 出去外面
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.52,1:15:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.56,1:15:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.56,1:15:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 这不是游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.68,1:15:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.23,1:15:16.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了保护地球
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.94,1:15:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.26,1:15:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.21,1:15:44.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷达损坏 撤退
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.89,1:15:48.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打中了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.29,1:15:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被击中了 紧急脱出
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.59,1:15:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要输给大雄了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.58,1:15:58.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被击中了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.96,1:16:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不会输的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.87,1:16:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 太多了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.55,1:16:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 不如将基地的控制塔破坏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.22,1:16:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 大雄 帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.08,1:16:20.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.15,1:16:23.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前居然没想到...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.31,1:16:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 小夫 胖虎 麻烦你们援助射击
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.09,1:16:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 交给我们
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.06,1:16:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.76,1:16:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那个
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.46,1:16:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然喷了『宇宙霜』
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.70,1:16:52.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过因为重力很小 要小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.46,1:16:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.26,1:17:00.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,近处看真大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.57,1:17:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来很难破坏
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.59,1:17:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 用这个
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.31,1:17:08.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『黏土粉』
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.55,1:17:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撒上这个 不管什么东西 都会变得像粘土那样软绵绵
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.68,1:17:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.54,1:17:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 搓圆吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.74,1:17:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样控制塔就不能用了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.56,1:17:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事 敌人的飞船都不动了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.74,1:17:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.18,1:17:30.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是他们
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.03,1:17:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 控制杆被破坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.04,1:17:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修复不能 攻击艇全灭
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.00,1:17:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是那帮地球人搞得鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.51,1:17:45.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今 我们只有潜入盖亚号
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.03,1:17:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,占领控制室
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.74,1:17:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.20,1:17:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直一模一样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.65,1:17:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不像
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.29,1:18:09.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.41,1:18:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.62,1:18:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还还还 还好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.25,1:18:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.98,1:18:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.76,1:18:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.43,1:18:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 摩亚打算将这个要塞开进盖亚号
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.90,1:18:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 他就在这里咯？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.95,1:18:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.05,1:18:41.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们进去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.44,1:18:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.23,1:18:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.44,1:18:53.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『通行圈』
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.15,1:18:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快进去里面
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.67,1:19:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令室好像是在这边
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.53,1:19:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.59,1:19:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也进去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.13,1:19:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 洛古 去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.10,1:19:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.57,1:19:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本无法接近啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.45,1:19:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 你们根本不是对手
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.04,1:19:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离接触还有1分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.83,1:19:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.11,1:19:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用盖亚号的权限控制全市
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.64,1:19:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,支配那些市民的时候到了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.60,1:19:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会得逞的 摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.92,1:19:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.07,1:19:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里…里安
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.25,1:19:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 你是被摩亚的超能力控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.42,1:19:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 300年来 盖亚号的市民
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.90,1:19:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多么希望找到母星-地球啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.67,1:19:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在跟市民一起 拿起武器战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.25,1:19:56.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.51,1:19:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 过来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.40,1:20:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.39,1:20:01.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.42,1:20:08.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左舷 UFO接近
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.44,1:20:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在往控制室方向航行中
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.40,1:20:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,推测30秒前
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.04,1:20:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 连你也...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.76,1:20:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神树之果
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.24,1:20:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 快杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.44,1:20:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.00,1:20:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.30,1:20:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.77,1:20:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始与盖亚号衔接
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.29,1:20:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衔接完成
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.59,1:20:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 快开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.20,1:21:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特 你这个混蛋...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.30,1:21:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚 觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.16,1:21:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.91,1:21:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.94,1:21:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.54,1:21:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.84,1:21:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.75,1:21:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚的超能力 敌不过里安爸爸心中的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.92,1:21:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 真对不起 请原谅爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.39,1:21:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.74,1:21:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.02,1:21:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.88,1:21:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,李贝尔特司令官 我们到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.22,1:21:47.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都被它控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.41,1:21:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.05,1:21:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.94,1:21:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.63,1:21:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知心的朋友们 都还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.38,1:22:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.59,1:22:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被里安打败了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.43,1:22:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.29,1:22:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.69,1:22:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球得救了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.96,1:22:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.68,1:22:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.89,1:22:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.41,1:22:11.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 里安
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.12,1:22:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听里安说了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.17,1:22:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦酱 真的很感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.04,1:22:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦酱...  我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.03,1:22:23.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么也没做 是里安的勇气获得了胜利
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.62,1:22:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里安 摩亚到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.48,1:22:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙是...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.00,1:22:30.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机 机器人来的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.72,1:22:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,构造很简单的机器人嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.48,1:22:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像蜕下来的空壳一样
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.24,1:22:38.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙居然拥有超能力 太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.28,1:22:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.28,1:22:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盖亚号的轨道 向要塞的惑星前进了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.41,1:22:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无法控制
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.00,1:22:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是衔接的时候出现了故障
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.88,1:22:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶紧与盖亚号联系
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.69,1:22:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去会跟惑星相撞的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.03,1:22:59.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.78,1:23:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你这么说...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.57,1:23:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法躲开吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.72,1:23:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.72,1:23:07.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.42,1:23:11.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.40,1:23:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它对"相对静止"的行星起不了作用
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.59,1:23:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是对"相对运动"着的盖亚号用呢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.73,1:23:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.05,1:23:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『回射斗篷』太小了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.13,1:23:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『放大灯』放大
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.43,1:23:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.54,1:23:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一支『放大灯』 威力不够
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.00,1:23:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『复制镜』大量复制
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.96,1:23:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 真聪明啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.68,1:23:42.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 按照计划
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.07,1:23:44.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.88,1:23:47.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.45,1:23:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.81,1:23:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说明了 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.16,1:23:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.30,1:23:59.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全束手无策
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.68,1:24:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 拿好『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.20,1:24:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等收到信号 就一起照射『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.06,1:24:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,团队合作很重要的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.36,1:24:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.26,1:24:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 这样下去的话...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.47,1:24:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们三百年的历史就到此为止了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.62,1:24:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.77,1:24:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.99,1:24:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.66,1:24:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.48,1:24:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.76,1:24:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『回射斗篷』
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.26,1:25:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司令官 轨道修正了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.90,1:25:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.28,1:25:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上进行修复工作
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.96,1:25:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.83,1:25:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 做得好
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.34,1:25:24.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.13,1:25:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.53,1:25:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我控制得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.12,1:25:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.16,1:25:31.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯旋回归
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.04,1:25:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.91,1:25:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬间跳跃航行装置修好了 就送你们回地球吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.20,1:25:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,菲莉亚 都说了将破烂儿都搬走嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.10,1:25:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不是破烂儿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.93,1:25:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些都是大家对地球的回忆
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.20,1:25:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 很快就要分开了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.97,1:25:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.01,1:26:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是摩亚
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.24,1:26:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体连带太多东西 出不来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.97,1:26:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.72,1:26:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『硬硬灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.11,1:26:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你变得硬邦邦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.14,1:26:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是摩亚？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.84,1:26:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那个机器人吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.04,1:26:26.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 摩亚没有属于自己的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.65,1:26:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是它进入了机器人里面
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.52,1:26:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个要怎么处理
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.31,1:26:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五分钟后就会回复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.01,1:26:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.16,1:26:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『飞行行李签-宇宙版』
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.40,1:26:40.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写上寄送地址
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.54,1:26:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要寄出去？哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.18,1:26:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑洞
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.06,1:26:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩亚到底是什么来的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.34,1:27:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概是隐藏在大家内心的邪恶凝聚物
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.58,1:27:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位 我在此再次宣言
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.38,1:27:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会遵从尤古道之树的教导
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.71,1:27:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论什么情况 都不容许用武力去移居某星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.95,1:27:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了能找到可以和平移居的星球 我们会继续旅程
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.10,1:27:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在宇宙的某处 一定有个可以成为我们故乡的星球 等着我们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.85,1:27:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的旅程是走向未来的希望之旅
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.54,1:27:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们一定 要保护好这美丽的地球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.49,1:28:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了不重蹈拉古娜星的悲剧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.95,1:28:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.75,1:28:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会努力的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.77,1:28:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会努力的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.07,1:28:07.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.65,1:28:09.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 里安 多多保重
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.14,1:28:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一定会找到一个美丽的星球的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.30,1:28:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会找到的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.47,1:28:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.14,1:28:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.74,1:28:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于回到地球了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.52,1:28:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.66,1:28:33.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.99,1:28:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 待会见
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.51,1:28:37.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 我玩的很高兴
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.66,1:28:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.05,1:28:41.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是又去了幻觉之星的话
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.20,1:28:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.90,1:28:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.74,1:28:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这是之前的测验卷
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.31,1:28:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,测验卷
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.81,1:28:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,0分
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.51,1:28:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 不是幻觉
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.31,1:28:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.21,1:29:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 有什么好的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.36,1:29:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.81,1:29:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 太好了 呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.91,1:29:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...呢

